      "created_at": "2016-02-16T00:09:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I sincerely doubt there is a connection between Luminary/Baron Blade and the Scholar. That is most likely one of his inventions he's wearing on his left hand.</p><p>He invented something to help Sky-Scraper, he didn't use alchemy. Context is important, and contextually, Luminary uses inventions while the Scholar uses alchemy. There's no connection.</p>",
